  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "r0b0tlab's audited production lane for the official DeepSeek V4 Flash DSpark checkpoint (913f0657) on two GB10 Sparks: Anemll's digest-pinned dspark-vllm-gx10 image (vLLM 0.25.2.dev0, FlashInfer 0.6.15), FlashInfer B12X MoE, native DSpark speculative decoding at k=5, NVFP4 MLA KV cache and RoCE tensor parallel 2. Upstream production profile: 200,000 token context, 16 sequences, 16K batched tokens, 0.84 memory utilization. Upstream's 384K and 1M profiles run a different legacy Stage-C image and are not included. Licences: r0b0tlab package MIT AND Apache-2.0, model MIT (information only). Performance figures are upstream claims, not measured here.",
